<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Echlin EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Echlin EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers cut its fourth quarter earnings per share estimate for Echlin Inc to $0.68 from $0.75, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday Lehman cut its estimate to $0.75 from $0.80, the source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/4 at 30-1/2.</p>
</text>
